sequenceDiagram
    participant MainThread as Main Thread
    participant WorkerThread as Worker Thread
    participant Dispatcher as AsyncDispatcher

    MainThread->>Dispatcher: addTask(heavyTask)
    activate Dispatcher
    Dispatcher->>WorkerThread: execute(heavyTask)
    deactivate Dispatcher
    Note right of WorkerThread: Processing...

    WorkerThread-->>Dispatcher: taskComplete(result)
    activate Dispatcher
    Dispatcher-->>MainThread: onTaskComplete(result)
    deactivate Dispatcher
